{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Or if he buys.</b> A verbal noun, and the place is lacking: 'from your acquisitions you bought' (מקנה קניתם קנה). So too 'Remember the Sabbath day' (זכור את יום השבת), and many like these." "And the meaning of <b>you shall sell</b>: plural form, because of witnesses. And likewise the meaning of <b>you shall not wrong</b>: only corresponding to the number of years."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:19.351608265Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}